# Code ownership.
#
# Ownership here is about who must review, not who may write. Once the branch ruleset
# in docs/branch-protection.md is applied, a CODEOWNERS entry becomes a required
# reviewer for the paths it matches.
#
# Only one human is involved today, so every path routes to the same owner. The value
# of the file now is that guardrail and security-sensitive paths are enumerated, so
# adding a second reviewer later is a one-line change rather than an audit.

